WEBVTT

00:06.980 --> 00:09.360
Now, drink to your heart's content!

00:09.360 --> 00:10.650
Sei!

00:11.320 --> 00:15.910
The director is calling for you! 
Someone from the royal palace is here!

00:15.910 --> 00:17.500
The royal palace?

00:20.840 --> 00:23.670
My debut ceremony?

00:23.670 --> 00:26.420
Yes. We would formally like 
to introduce our Holy Saint

00:26.420 --> 00:30.380
to the nobility and other 
prominent figures of our kingdom.

00:30.380 --> 00:32.850
<i>Really? After all this time?</i>

00:32.850 --> 00:35.310
Are you thinking, "After all this time?"

00:35.520 --> 00:36.980
<i>Is he a mind reader?</i>

00:38.670 --> 00:41.260
We unexpectedly summoned 
two people with the ritual.

00:41.260 --> 00:45.710
The royal palace has also been busy
dealing with the monster threat all along.

00:45.710 --> 00:46.940
Yes, indeed.

00:46.940 --> 00:51.260
But now that threat
 has died back significantly.

00:51.260 --> 00:53.770
They finally have a chance
 to make things official.

00:53.770 --> 00:54.870
Yes, indeed.

00:55.790 --> 01:02.040
I-I mean, didn't we basically
 already do this?

01:02.350 --> 01:04.970
That was merely a public apology.

01:04.970 --> 01:09.760
His Majesty now wishes to properly 
introduce you to the public.

01:10.160 --> 01:12.720
<i>So it's a royal request, is it?</i>

01:13.280 --> 01:15.140
I understand.

01:15.140 --> 01:17.430
Let's see. The ceremony is planned for...

01:18.860 --> 01:20.140
Isn't this date...

01:20.140 --> 01:24.690
It will be the same day
 as the ball held by the royal family.

01:25.100 --> 01:26.360
There's a ball?

01:26.360 --> 01:28.400
I see.

01:28.400 --> 01:30.810
It's the last ball of the season.

01:30.810 --> 01:35.570
This will ensure that everyone 
of any importance will be there.

01:35.570 --> 01:38.350
Yes. The ceremony will be that day,

01:38.350 --> 01:41.030
and the ball will be held in the evening.

01:42.250 --> 01:44.920
<i>I would like to join you as your escort.</i>

01:46.820 --> 01:48.080
A ball, huh?

01:48.080 --> 01:49.620
Sounds like a big deal.

01:50.020 --> 01:52.960
Why are you talking like it 
has nothing to do with you?

01:53.380 --> 01:56.100
You'll be attending both.

01:59.020 --> 02:00.590
I have to go to the ball too?!

03:40.760 --> 03:43.250
So, what's up?

03:43.250 --> 03:44.330
Come again?

03:44.330 --> 03:46.850
You were in quite a panic.

03:46.850 --> 03:48.370
Do you hate balls that much?

03:48.370 --> 03:51.870
Oh, I don't hate them.

03:51.870 --> 03:56.050
I just don't like being
 the center of attention...

03:56.360 --> 03:59.240
I hope I can be a wallflower.

03:59.580 --> 04:02.150
Actually, I'd rather just be the wall.

04:04.510 --> 04:06.460
Yeah, that's not happening.

04:06.460 --> 04:08.020
You don't think so?

04:08.020 --> 04:11.020
Not a chance. You're the Holy Saint.

04:11.020 --> 04:14.230
<i>The Holy Saint, a wall?
 Yeah, not happening.</i>

04:16.860 --> 04:19.360
I received an invitation as well.

04:19.360 --> 04:22.840
So don't worry. I'll try to stay 
with you as much as possible.

04:23.270 --> 04:24.910
Thank you very much.

04:24.910 --> 04:26.090
Of course.

04:26.500 --> 04:29.930
Although Al will be there, too.

04:29.930 --> 04:32.530
He'll probably make a good shield.

04:33.460 --> 04:36.180
O-Oh, Commander Hawke...

04:36.180 --> 04:38.160
You think he'll attend?

04:40.600 --> 04:43.280
He's the Commander of the Third Order.

04:43.280 --> 04:45.610
I don't doubt he was invited.

04:45.610 --> 04:46.850
You're right.

04:47.240 --> 04:54.060
Well, knowing him, he'll probably 
ask to be your escort to the ball.

04:55.270 --> 04:56.350
What?

04:57.040 --> 04:59.350
O-Oh, I'm just not so sure...

04:59.350 --> 05:01.450
Who knows if he will?

05:02.830 --> 05:03.950
Is that so?

05:03.950 --> 05:05.250
Director!

05:05.910 --> 05:07.800
Do you have a minute?

05:07.800 --> 05:09.720
Yeah, I'm coming.

05:14.590 --> 05:16.120
<i>He totally will!</i>

05:16.120 --> 05:19.550
<i>He absolutely said he would before!</i>

05:22.710 --> 05:26.410
<i>But maybe he was just being polite.</i>

05:27.200 --> 05:31.270
<i>He might not even remember he said it...</i>

05:31.270 --> 05:34.270
"The Ceremony"

05:34.890 --> 05:38.940
Would you grant me the honor 
of escorting you to the ball?

05:41.200 --> 05:45.210
I heard that you'll be attending
after your debut ceremony.

05:45.210 --> 05:46.200
What do you say?

05:46.200 --> 05:47.600
Oh, yes.

05:47.600 --> 05:51.620
Uh, um, gladly.

05:52.030 --> 05:53.830
That's great. Thank goodness.

05:56.290 --> 05:59.410
Where shall I come to pick you up?

05:59.410 --> 06:04.700
Oh, um, I'll be in the royal 
palace all day that day...

06:04.700 --> 06:07.760
Understood. I'll come fetch you
from the reception hall.

06:07.760 --> 06:09.260
O-Okay.

06:09.260 --> 06:11.550
Um, I said I'd be at the palace all day,

06:11.550 --> 06:15.280
but I'll actually be staying there
 the night before, too.

06:15.280 --> 06:17.140
The maids are all fired up

06:17.140 --> 06:21.370
since I'll be wearing something different
for the ceremony and the ball.

06:21.370 --> 06:22.440
I see.

06:22.440 --> 06:26.350
I feel bad since all I'll be doing
 is sitting around.

06:26.350 --> 06:29.870
I told them to do as they please, but...

06:30.440 --> 06:31.330
Huh?

06:34.430 --> 06:38.000
I look forward to seeing you dressed up
for a special occasion.

06:48.240 --> 06:51.270
Good morning, Lady Sei.

06:52.980 --> 06:55.090
Good morning...

06:55.090 --> 06:57.990
How do you find the pillows
of the royal palace?

06:57.990 --> 06:59.440
Oh, of course!

07:00.900 --> 07:03.200
I slept quite well.

07:05.630 --> 07:08.070
<i>Whoa, my face feels so supple.</i>

07:08.070 --> 07:10.360
Is something the matter?

07:10.360 --> 07:14.420
Not at all. I'm just amazed 
how healthy my skin has gotten.

07:14.420 --> 07:16.100
Well, of course.

07:16.100 --> 07:19.540
We've been using the cosmetics
 you created, Lady Sei.

07:19.540 --> 07:23.510
No, I think it's all thanks
 to your massages, Marie.

07:23.510 --> 07:25.450
You're too kind.

07:25.450 --> 07:26.470
Now, then...

07:34.150 --> 07:37.380
Girls, it's time to dress Lady Sei.

07:38.100 --> 07:39.060
Huh?

07:44.650 --> 07:46.320
<i>Who the heck is this?</i>

07:46.760 --> 07:48.910
My, it looks splendid on you!

07:48.910 --> 07:51.780
Everyone will recognize you
 as the Holy Saint in an instant.

07:51.780 --> 07:53.240
Yes! Yes!

07:53.240 --> 07:58.690
Um, I feel like this is a little more...
no, <i>way</i> more lavish than last time.

07:58.690 --> 08:03.040
We strive to hone our skills 
further each day, Lady Sei.

08:04.170 --> 08:07.380
Th-Thank you very much...

08:07.990 --> 08:10.980
<i>I feel like this is all kinda wasted on me.</i>

08:10.980 --> 08:13.940
<i>No, thinking that way
is an insult to the maids' hard work.</i>

08:13.940 --> 08:16.600
<i>Gotta block out those thoughts. Yeah!</i>

08:18.600 --> 08:20.800
Are you ready yet, my lady?

08:20.800 --> 08:22.900
Well then, have a pleasant time.

08:23.640 --> 08:24.420
I will.

08:27.280 --> 08:32.060
Thus, we performed 
the Saint-summoning ritual

08:32.060 --> 08:34.790
passed down since ancient times.

08:35.350 --> 08:38.150
Through it, a Holy Saint 
descended upon Salutania

08:38.150 --> 08:42.710
to dispel the dark miasma 
threatening to engulf us.

08:43.380 --> 08:46.180
Today, I would formally like to introduce her.

08:46.180 --> 08:51.710
Please welcome Holy Saint Sei Takanashi
with a grand round of applause!

09:06.820 --> 09:10.420
Lady Takanashi has traveled
 the land with our forces

09:10.420 --> 09:13.200
and achieved incredible feats.

09:13.820 --> 09:16.930
Everyone here is already aware

09:16.930 --> 09:21.290
of the dwindling number of monsters
 appearing from miasma swamps.

09:21.990 --> 09:27.030
People of Salutania, 
peace is no longer a distant dream!

09:27.490 --> 09:30.470
All thanks to our Holy Saint!

09:35.180 --> 09:36.430
Good work.

09:36.430 --> 09:37.820
I'm sure you're tired.

09:37.820 --> 09:40.250
Rest up until the ball.

09:40.890 --> 09:42.620
I'll see you tonight.

09:49.950 --> 09:52.280
That's the first hurdle cleared.

09:55.210 --> 09:57.200
I've returned.

09:57.480 --> 09:59.080
Welcome back.

09:59.080 --> 10:01.160
You did splendidly.

10:01.160 --> 10:03.670
Your friends are waiting for you.

10:10.510 --> 10:11.760
Liz!

10:11.760 --> 10:14.300
I'm sorry to impose 
when you must be exhausted.

10:14.300 --> 10:19.720
I wished to see your attire up close 
and couldn't help myself.

10:19.720 --> 10:20.720
Don't fret.

10:20.720 --> 10:23.370
I don't mind at all. Think nothing of it.

10:27.960 --> 10:29.150
Who is this?

10:29.990 --> 10:33.420
I apologize for failing to introduce myself.

10:33.420 --> 10:36.620
My name is Rayne Salutania.

10:37.100 --> 10:41.650
It is an honor to meet 
the Holy Saint in person.

10:42.360 --> 10:45.540
This is the second prince of our kingdom.

10:47.870 --> 10:49.910
<i>He's that guy's little brother?!</i>

10:50.500 --> 10:52.770
Th-The honor is all mine.

10:52.770 --> 10:56.430
Um, it's nice to meet you. 
I'm Sei Takanashi.

10:56.430 --> 10:58.470
You were just introduced moments ago.

10:58.940 --> 11:03.470
Your Highness, why not try being
 a tad less formal?

11:03.470 --> 11:06.430
Sei doesn't relish rigid decorum.

11:07.460 --> 11:09.040
Is that so?

11:09.040 --> 11:10.690
I shall keep it in mind.

11:16.130 --> 11:19.570
Truth be told,
I have wished to meet you ever since

11:19.570 --> 11:22.320
first hearing about you from Lady Ashley.

11:22.320 --> 11:24.130
Even if only once.

11:25.020 --> 11:31.170
Lady Takanashi, allow me to apologize 
to you for my brother's rudeness.

11:31.170 --> 11:35.920
That's quite all right! His Majesty
 issued me a formal apology for as much.

11:35.920 --> 11:38.140
So do not worry, Your Highness.

11:38.140 --> 11:42.100
<i>Especially since I've already
completely forgotten about it!</i>

11:42.770 --> 11:46.690
I'm sincerely grateful for your kind words.

11:49.570 --> 11:54.960
Now that I've introduced you
 to His Highness, it's my turn.

11:55.530 --> 11:57.460
What do you mean?

11:57.460 --> 12:01.240
Well, I'm the one 
who wanted to speak with you,

12:01.240 --> 12:04.800
but he forced me to bring him along.

12:07.000 --> 12:09.860
I was rather surprised
to see you at the ceremony.

12:09.860 --> 12:11.920
I didn't think you would attend, Liz.

12:11.920 --> 12:15.950
I'm afraid the two of us cannot
attend the evening ball.

12:15.950 --> 12:21.140
This was our only chance
to see you all dressed up.

12:21.140 --> 12:22.370
I wouldn't miss it!

12:22.750 --> 12:24.860
<i>She wanted to see me dressed up?</i>

12:26.070 --> 12:29.810
But I always dress up to have tea with you...

12:29.810 --> 12:31.810
That's true,

12:32.200 --> 12:36.640
but I so rarely get to see you adorned
in such splendid robes.

12:37.580 --> 12:40.270
I'm glad I came today.

12:40.270 --> 12:41.690
As am I.

12:44.280 --> 12:48.270
What a wonderful lady. 
I'm glad I made you bring me along.

12:46.950 --> 12:50.670
<i>I wasn't at all looking forward to it</i>

12:48.530 --> 12:53.850
Of course. I am delighted
to call Sei my friend.

12:50.670 --> 12:55.170
<i>when I was first invited
to this debut ceremony...</i>

12:53.850 --> 12:55.690
Why do you look so proud, Liz?

12:56.280 --> 12:59.130
<i>Honestly, I wanted to refuse.</i>

12:56.480 --> 12:59.130
They say birds of a feather flock together.

12:59.480 --> 13:04.100
Since Sei is so wonderful, 
I'm sure I must be as well.

13:00.350 --> 13:04.840
<i>But if doing things like this 
makes Liz and the others happy,</i>

13:05.200 --> 13:08.320
<i>then I'm glad I went through with it.</i>

13:25.680 --> 13:27.620
<i>What a lovely dress...</i>

13:28.040 --> 13:32.560
<i>It's so beautiful, I'm not sure 
if I'm fit to wear it.</i>

13:34.270 --> 13:35.590
Excuse me.

13:35.590 --> 13:37.550
C-Come in!

13:53.920 --> 13:55.470
Commander Hawke!

13:55.470 --> 13:57.680
Thank you for escorting me this evening.

13:58.060 --> 13:59.080
Of course...

14:03.530 --> 14:04.920
Commander Hawke?

14:04.920 --> 14:06.630
Oh, I'm sorry.

14:08.180 --> 14:09.700
You're just so beautiful...

14:09.700 --> 14:10.790
What?

14:11.600 --> 14:14.370
I couldn't help being mesmerized by you.

14:16.040 --> 14:17.780
Oh, don't say that.

14:17.780 --> 14:20.840
Um, you're the one who...

14:20.840 --> 14:22.050
Yes?

14:22.050 --> 14:24.510
Oh, nothing! Don't mind me!

14:25.270 --> 14:26.550
<i>Calm down!</i>

14:26.550 --> 14:28.970
<i>What was I just about to say?!</i>

14:34.440 --> 14:36.960
<i>Wh-What should I do?</i>

14:36.960 --> 14:39.680
<i>Is there any way to shake this mood?</i>

14:40.650 --> 14:42.250
Pardon me.

14:43.380 --> 14:46.320
It's almost time. Please make haste.

14:49.740 --> 14:51.740
<i>No!</i>

14:55.950 --> 15:00.000
From House Grellman,
Lord Olaf escorting Lady Iris.

15:06.980 --> 15:08.520
Are you nervous?

15:11.140 --> 15:12.920
Very nervous.

15:12.920 --> 15:15.750
I've thoroughly studied royal etiquette,

15:15.750 --> 15:18.360
but I'm worried about putting it to practice.

15:28.020 --> 15:29.940
From House Hawke,

15:29.940 --> 15:33.410
Lord Albert Hawke
escorting Lady Sei Takanashi.

15:34.380 --> 15:35.620
Let's go.

15:36.070 --> 15:36.890
Yes.

16:01.030 --> 16:03.480
<i>Smile. Smile.</i>

16:03.970 --> 16:07.050
<i>Gracefully. Elegantly.</i>

16:07.050 --> 16:10.630
<i>It's okay. I just need to do it 
exactly how I learned.</i>

16:12.040 --> 16:12.880
Sei.

16:13.520 --> 16:15.000
Yes?

16:19.470 --> 16:20.750
Look at me.

16:26.810 --> 16:29.990
I'm sorry. Thank you very much.

16:30.440 --> 16:36.520
<i>I can't handle such a fierce move 
 when my hands are already full!</i>

16:36.990 --> 16:40.000
No, I should be the one to apologize.

16:40.000 --> 16:42.520
You looked so nervous,
 I couldn't help myself.

16:45.700 --> 16:46.780
I'm sorry.

16:47.620 --> 16:51.440
<i>What's with that dazzling smile 
even when he's apologizing?</i>

17:05.920 --> 17:11.130
Sei, it was a pleasure to dance 
with you tonight. Thank you.

17:11.130 --> 17:14.270
The pleasure was mine. Thank you very much.

17:23.720 --> 17:25.520
Hey. Good job, you two.

17:26.320 --> 17:27.530
Thank you.

17:29.230 --> 17:34.200
Looks like all that practice 
was worth it, Sei. You danced very well.

17:34.200 --> 17:35.910
<i>The director?!</i>

17:36.470 --> 17:38.870
<i>I didn't recognize him for a second...</i>

17:39.370 --> 17:41.560
Why not have a dance yourself, Johan?

17:41.560 --> 17:43.010
Don't ask the impossible.

17:43.010 --> 17:45.600
How long do you think it's been 
since I last danced?

17:45.600 --> 17:48.300
But if you don't dance...

17:52.910 --> 17:55.890
Our Holy Saint is quite popular.

17:56.210 --> 17:58.520
Everyone's waiting for their chance to ask.

17:59.270 --> 18:02.980
Well, I came because I expected as much.

18:03.370 --> 18:08.190
I'll stall for time. 
You go and call for reinforcements.

18:08.190 --> 18:09.190
Right.

18:10.920 --> 18:11.900
Now, then...

18:16.820 --> 18:20.200
May I have this dance?

18:20.790 --> 18:22.310
Director?

18:23.500 --> 18:28.190
Didn't you learn that it's poor form
 to dance with the same partner twice?

18:28.190 --> 18:30.210
I'm sorry I'm not Al. Bear with it.

18:30.210 --> 18:32.470
D-Don't put words in my mouth!

18:32.470 --> 18:37.180
Wouldn't you rather dance with me 
than some random man?

19:02.270 --> 19:04.230
I see reinforcements have arrived.

19:05.170 --> 19:05.940
Huh?

19:10.610 --> 19:13.090
Good evening, Lady Sei.

19:13.370 --> 19:14.800
Marquis Drewes!

19:14.800 --> 19:20.610
I rushed over when I heard this was 
the perfect chance to dance with you.

19:21.420 --> 19:22.370
<i>He's lying.</i>

19:22.370 --> 19:25.480
<i>This guy is only interested in magic.</i>

19:25.480 --> 19:27.060
<i>He's definitely lying.</i>

19:43.380 --> 19:45.290
I heard, Sei,

19:45.870 --> 19:51.060
that you were the object
of every lady's envy at the ball.

19:51.060 --> 19:53.790
Oh, I heard that as well.

19:53.790 --> 20:01.900
The Grand Magus and Magus are both 
famous for avoiding such events.

20:01.900 --> 20:05.190
My! It must have been quite a sight.

20:05.560 --> 20:08.770
Why do you seem so tickled, Liz?

20:09.570 --> 20:14.260
Still, I didn't realize that different 
men lead in different ways.

20:14.260 --> 20:18.200
I'd really only danced with my 
teacher before, so I hadn't realized.

20:18.670 --> 20:21.930
Whose lead did you enjoy the most?

20:26.330 --> 20:28.790
Well...

20:34.900 --> 20:36.310
I'm not sure.

22:07.970 --> 22:09.710
It's so peaceful.

22:10.090 --> 22:11.100
What's wrong?

22:11.100 --> 22:16.450
Nothing. I was just thinking that nothing's 
changed after my debut ceremony.

22:17.100 --> 22:22.570
Oh, well, I'm sure that the royal palace 
is taking care of the issue.

22:23.240 --> 22:24.780
What issue?

22:25.020 --> 22:30.000
All the men who wanted to get 
close to you during the ball.

22:33.290 --> 22:39.100
We were able to guard you that night, 
but I doubt many of them have given up.

22:39.540 --> 22:44.660
I'll bet you're getting all sorts of 
invitations to evening events and tea parties.

22:44.660 --> 22:47.720
I haven't received a single one.

22:47.720 --> 22:50.420
That's what I meant.
I'm sure the royal palace

22:50.420 --> 22:53.150
is politely declining them for you.

22:53.940 --> 22:59.290
The Holy Saint is an important figure 
who accompanies our forces.

22:59.290 --> 23:02.190
The royal palace knows that 
better than anyone.

23:02.190 --> 23:04.560
But I haven't been on any expeditions lately.

23:04.560 --> 23:07.620
I'm glad to hear that new miasma
 swamps aren't cropping up.

23:09.330 --> 23:13.760
Then it sounds like your days 
will be full of research again.

23:13.760 --> 23:15.250
Probably so.

23:17.420 --> 23:18.360
Come in.

23:22.470 --> 23:25.510
Lady Sei, please come to the royal palace.

23:27.220 --> 23:31.930
His Majesty has something important 
to discuss with you.

23:34.930 --> 23:39.940
Next Time

23:34.930 --> 23:39.940
"The Imperial Prince"
